    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Northwest: The new way between\nthe U.S.A. and Europe.\nAIORTHWEST ORIENT\nNORTHWEST ORIENT\nROOMY\nThe wide-cabin airline\nNorthwest's transatlantic\nOur roomy wide-cabin jets\nservice has more going\nare the most comfortable going! for you, too:\nOther airlines have squeezed an extra seat into\n• Regal Imperial Service -\nevery row in Economy on their wide-cabin jets\nincluding choice of entrees\nand complimentary wine in\nbetween the U.S.A. and Europe.\nEconomy\nThe result: Narrower seats. Narrower armrests.\n• 747 upper deck First Class\nLess comfort all-around.\nlounge\nBut Northwest isn't adding seats. Our big 747s\n• On-board low duty-free\nare just as roomy as ever. With wider seats.\nshopping prices\nWider armrests. More comfort all around.\n• Exclusive 25% discount on\nWe think that's the kind of comfort you deserve -\nHertz Car Rental in Glasgow,\nespecially on long transatlantic flights.\nCopenhagen and Stockholm"
    ],
